<% popover = Gustwave::Popover.new(class: "w-96") %>

<div class="flex justify-center pt-64">
  <%= render Gustwave::Paragraph.new do %>
    Due to its central geographic location in Southern Europe,
    <%= render Gustwave::Link.new("Italy", href: "#", underline: :always, class: "font-normal", **popover.trigger_options) %>
    has historically been home to myriad peoples and cultures. In addition to the various ancient peoples dispersed
    throughout what is now modern-day Italy, the most predominant being the Indo-European Italic peoples who gave the
    peninsula its name, beginning from the classical era, Phoenicians and Carthaginians founded colonies mostly in
    insular Italy.
  <% end %>

  <%= render popover do %>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-5">
      <div class="col-span-3 p-3">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <%= render Gustwave::Heading.new("About Italy", tag: :h3, size: :none, class: "font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white") %>

          <p>
            Italy is located in the middle of the Mediterranean Sea, in Southern Europe it is also considered part of
            Western Europe. A unitary parliamentary republic with Rome as its capital and largest city.
          </p>

          <%= render Gustwave::Link.new(href: "#", class: "flex items-center hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-600") do %>
            Read more <%= render Gustwave::Icon.new(:chevron_right_compact, class: "w-2 h-2 ms-1.5 rtl:rotate-180") %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%= image_tag "/icon.png", alt: "Italy map", class: "h-full col-span-2" %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
